// 演出写错的地方:时间单位和时间基不合、越出长度、范围倒着写、动词不在这条轨上、该写范围的写成了时刻、切到没声明的
// 机位、切镜头时没有遮罩盖住、改了世界没放回去、绝对时间的演出没写长度、play 了跟着台词走的演出。

character 狼

stage 没有长度
// EXPECT DNS7009 (6,1)
  camera
    0.0s     blend from game 0.3s
    1.0s     blend back 0.3s

stage 秒里写百分数
  duration 2.0s
  game
    50%      input lock
// EXPECT DNS7004 (15,5)

stage 台词里写秒
  base: line
  duration 2.0s
// EXPECT DNS7004 (20,3)
  camera
    0.5s     push 4cm over 100%
// EXPECT DNS7004 (23,5)
    0%       push 4cm over 2.0s
// EXPECT DNS7004 (25,28)

stage 越出长度
  duration 2.0s
  camera
    0.0s     blend from game 0.3s
    3.0s     blend back 0.3s
// EXPECT DNS7002 (32,5)
  restore
    camera   blend back 0.3s

stage 倒着的范围
  duration 2.0s
  game
    2.0s..1.0s   input lock
// EXPECT DNS7005 (40,5)

stage 不认识的
  duration 2.0s
  speed: fast
// EXPECT DNS7006 (45,3)
  camera
    0.0s     zoom 2x
// EXPECT DNS7006 (48,5)
  light
    0.0s     ramp dark
// EXPECT DNS7006 (51,5)
  restore
    ui       hide hud
// EXPECT DNS7006 (54,5)

stage 范围与时刻
  duration 2.0s
  shots
    近景     local (0, -100, 50) look 狼
  mask
    0.0s..1.0s   cut black
    1.0s         distort strength 0.5
// EXPECT DNS7007 (63,5)
  camera
    0.0s..1.0s   cut -> 近景
// EXPECT DNS7007 (66,5)
    1.5s         blend back 0.2s

stage 没声明的机位
  duration 2.0s
  mask
    0.0s..2.0s   cut black
  camera
    0.5s     cut -> 没有的机位
// EXPECT DNS7008 (75,5)
    1.5s     blend back 0.2s

stage 没盖住的一刀
  duration 2.0s
  shots
    近景     local (0, -100, 50) look 狼
  mask
    0.0s..0.5s   distort strength 0.8
  camera
    1.0s     cut -> 近景
// EXPECT DNS7001 (86,5)
    1.5s     blend back 0.2s

stage 没放回去
  duration 2.0s
  camera
    0.0s     blend from game 0.3s
// EXPECT DNS7003 (93,5)
  ui
    0.0s     hide hud
// EXPECT DNS7003 (96,5)
    0.5s     text 「狼来了」
// EXPECT DNS7003 (98,5)
  light
    0.0s     ramp dark 0.5s
// EXPECT DNS7003 (101,5)
    0.0s     key 狼 on
// EXPECT DNS7003 (103,5)

stage 跟着台词
  base: line
  camera
    0%       push 4cm over 100%

dialogue 狼_来了 for 狼
  狼: 嗷。
  play 跟着台词
// EXPECT DNS7010 (113,3)
